<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1388357984"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1475945111"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Wildflower"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="AIKA / juu"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Wildflower EP"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="02:58.630"><div begin="02:25.170" end="02:58.630"><p begin="02:25.170" end="02:29.150" itunes:key="L1">The crying heart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">战士的心在哭泣</span></p><p begin="02:29.150" end="02:33.660" itunes:key="L2">Of the warrior<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">战士的心</span></p><p begin="02:33.660" end="02:36.820" itunes:key="L3">As I wake and see<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当我醒来看见</span></p><p begin="02:36.820" end="02:42.570" itunes:key="L4">The shining colors from her eyes<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">她眼中闪烁的光芒</span></p><p begin="02:42.570" end="02:46.790" itunes:key="L5">Don't lose sight<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要迷失</span></p><p begin="02:46.790" end="02:50.660" itunes:key="L6">Of your love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对爱的视线</span></p><p begin="02:50.660" end="02:54.650" itunes:key="L7">Wildflower<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">永远的野花</span></p><p begin="02:54.650" end="02:58.630" itunes:key="L8">You're forever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是永恒</span></p></div></body></tt>